  "title": "Mediation with a threshold effect",
  "topology_basis": "printed_diagram",
  "content": "Figure 9.8 combines linear Education-to-Skill and Salary equations with a nonlinear job-acceptance threshold. It demonstrates that natural and controlled effects need not add as linear path products do.",
